  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Escalating economic coercion (sanctions, asset freezes and trade restrictions) triggers governments and firms to broaden export controls, compliance screening and restrictions on AI‑relevant hardware, software and data flows, increasing regulatory intensity.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
