  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Tighter sanctions and financial restrictions push Iranian entities and counterparties onto grey markets and surrogate suppliers for electronics, increasing the circulation of lower‑assurance, potentially backdoored hardware that can bleed into international supply chains.</data>
