  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.9</data>
  <data key="d36">A rising assessed probability of wider or spillover conflict causes firms and traders to expect abrupt new tariffs, export controls, and sanctions, sharply increasing uncertainty about future US trade policy directions.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_trade_coercion</data>
