  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher applied tariffs on imported servers, accelerators, and networking gear raise capital and operating costs for AI projects, reducing expected returns and causing firms and VCs to delay or scale back AI capital commitments.</data>
